  "description": "Torn from your past lives, you are a squad of criminals forced to serve a ruthless master. A deadly curse ensures your obedience, turning you into disposable pawns for an impossible mission. You are tasked with hunting a target of unimaginable importance in a land on the brink of war. Operating in the shadows where every step is watched, you must fight for survival and decide whether to obey your orders or risk everything to change your fate.",

